Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince and Qiqi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,kept flying forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,they came to a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,full of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So many books!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stacked higher
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,than houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi curiously
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,opened one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it had pictures of mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,rivers, and oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,An old man with round glasses sat in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the middle of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,book piles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a geographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I write books about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must know so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,many places!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've written them all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,in my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi's eyes lit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to so many places!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The geographer pushed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,up his glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi's mouth dropped ope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,n.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Geographers don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We only write
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who tells you what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,mountains look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Explorers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They go out and see things,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then come back and tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and I write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi thought for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran to the book piles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and sniffed hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.74,0:01:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the books smell
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.63,0:01:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,like paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,smell like wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No smell of flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,no smell of rain either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The geographer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,was stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince said softly — Books hold a lot of knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but only by really going there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,can you smell the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi nodded firmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When I grow up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go see for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll write the smell of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,wind into books too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The geographer smiled and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,picked up his quill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be an
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,come back and tell me what the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,on the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,smells like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,where would you most
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,like to explore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Qiqi in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,comments
